# Edit Node from the command menu shows the block's dates and flag, and Esc returns to editing at the same column.
file <<END
- Pay rent @due(2026-11-01) @flag
END
see Pay rent
keys <Enter> <Left> <Left> /
type edit node
keys <Enter>
see Edit Node
see Sun 1 Nov 2026
see Flagged
keys <Esc>
hide Edit Node
type Z
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- Pay reZnt @due(2026-11-01) @flag
END
